      "value": "@{5b8cc39b2734df12abfb8347|full_name}: That is really unfortunate because it makes it impossible to tell which users \"dropped\" VRChat. My friends list has exploded to a whopping 400+ friends and perhaps half of them are visitors who never joined again. \nYet a more prevalent issue is how if you defriend a bunch of users, VRChat will rank you down. Not too sure how much of an issue it is since there is no evidence of such, but some reassurance upon the reality of such issue would help.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
